plugins/hush1 - notices for the HUSH1 package (hush1.sh101, hush1.a64.rmp)

HUSH1's DSP is HUSH ONE's (src/dsp/sh101_osc.c, sh101_filter.c, sh101_env.c, sh101_control.c and the voice path of
sh101_plugin.c's render_block), ported to C for one voice a state and adapted for the Sidecar (hush1.c's header lists
the changes: PolyBLEP oscillators, a prewarped filter without upstream's bypass / synthetic self-oscillation, one ADSR
as on the SH-101, block-rate cutoff and glide, a click-free retrigger, no LFO / presets / note stack).
